{"title":"2020 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Education,_the_study_of_everything\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Education, the study of everything</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Alex_Explains\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Alex Explains</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/c/94cdfebdc087637cc5450da458e0db822c81da88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1-(-2)-3-(-4)-5-(-6)?\\]\" width=\"256\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/5/bd5ffcf907876e2be6b38306ea5e7bf72d9cd8f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -20 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\  3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"410\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that when we subtract negative numbers, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/c/0ac3fc24d21c85e8d9c759e9fb8d6a9a714551ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-(-b)=a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The equation becomes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/e/c8e85ef5e8b3aa958011a744d26877a24a60ffbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2-3+4-5+6 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"245\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~quacker88\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Like Solution 1, we know that when we subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/3/1632dd25121cb3c0bb1cc2ade004e55022b67406.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-(-b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />, that will equal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add2609af1bb7632cc22b68fd49fdd94de06b327.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> as the opposite/negative of a negative is a positive. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/b/7bbc026627838f719bc908f454b4ab268dd6ae34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-(-2)-3-(-4)-5-(-6)=1+2-3+4-5+6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"440\" height=\"18\" />. We can group together a few terms to make our computation a bit simpler. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2d0fd826230a16df5c4a7db089997a8f211f47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+(2-3)+4+(-5+6)= 1+(-1)+4+1=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"445\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~BakedPotato66\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/f/d9f5bd6720b48706621f06b6d430b61854fbfce2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-(-2)-3-(-4)-5-(-6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"252\" height=\"20\" /> has three groups: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6ce9d487069409da6501df4ff913b3ee82dea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-(-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/65635e3657c7a2eca2f03ce7d2133f0d67334139.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-3-(-4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b6dfe4ea8d5b03e0c20e891d9eb9dbf1d47bdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-5-(-6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The first group, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/6/2d6ce9d487069409da6501df4ff913b3ee82dea8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1-(-2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"71\" height=\"20\" />, can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/00500b0987c4218e2cb1c9f2c18ea6fba730cb6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-[-(a+1)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Simplify, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/5/00500b0987c4218e2cb1c9f2c18ea6fba730cb6e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a-[-(a+1)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/2/662bf4ca96dc2db6b88ecedff582469e59a8bb67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"49\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>The second and third groups can be expressed as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77a1ce88b47f9f7ec6bc604b0950cf00cdc53d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-c-[-(c+1)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Simplify,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77a1ce88b47f9f7ec6bc604b0950cf00cdc53d53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-c-[-(c+1)]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"124\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the sum of the three groups is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/8/1b8dc63e374c532cb0b4eff587bb179759cf5e51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot 1 + 1 + 1 + 1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"160\" height=\"15\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/a/c7a42524741cb8781a00318850f8d3183f191ac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"55\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~ lovelearning999\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Education.2C_the_study_of_everything\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Education,_the_study_of_everything\">Video Solution by Education, the study of everything</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Education, the study of everything\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NpDVTLSi-Ik\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NpDVTLSi-Ik</a> \n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TheBeautyofMath\">Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TheBeautyofMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Gkm5rU5MlOU\">https://youtu.be/Gkm5rU5MlOU</a>\n</p><p>~IceMatrix\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-wciFhP5h3I\">https://youtu.be/-wciFhP5h3I</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Alex_Explains\">Video Solution by Alex Explains</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Alex Explains\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNPAgQ8fSP0&amp;t\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GNPAgQ8fSP0&amp;t</a>\n</p><p>~AlexExplains\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2020_AMC_10B\" title=\"2020 AMC 10B\">2020 AMC 10B</a></b> (